Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.68,0:00:03.70,Default,Touko and Lain together (Lain can only be heard joining at the end),0,0,0,,谈话中，她说无法想象自己幸福。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.70,0:00:05.70,Default,Touko and Lain together (Lain can only be heard joining at the end),0,0,0,,她说对未来没有希望。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.24,0:00:10.48,Default,Touko and Lain together (Lain can only be heard joining at the end),0,0,0,,她失去了自信，陷入悲观情绪。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.54,0:00:13.80,Default,Touko and Lain together (Lain can only be heard joining at the end),0,0,0,,一受刺激她就会歇斯底里。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.66,0:00:18.26,Default,Touko and Lain together (Lain can only be heard joining at the end),0,0,0,,来访者一丝不苟、勤奋。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.26,0:00:21.70,Default,Touko and Lain together (Lain can only be heard joining at the end),0,0,0,,她对建立和谐的人际关系感到焦虑。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.70,0:00:25.64,Default,Touko and Lain together (Lain can only be heard joining at the end),0,0,0,,她多变而忧郁。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.44,0:00:31.94,Default,Touko and Lain together (Lain can only be heard joining at the end),0,0,0,,今后我会继续努力减轻她的心理负担并给予指导。
